"lemma":"மென்புனல்","gloss":"gentle water"}],"gloss":"gentle water","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வைப்பின்","parts":[{"text":"வைப்பு","lemma":"வைப்பு","gloss":"settlement"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the settlement"},{"surface":"இத்","parts":[{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"this"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"த்","gloss":"sandhi consonant"}],"gloss":"this"},{"surface":"தண்பணை","parts":[{"text":"தண்","lemma":"தண்மை","gloss":"cool"},{"text":"பணை","lemma":"பணை","gloss":"agricultural field"}],"gloss":"cool agricultural field"},{"surface":"ஊரே","parts":[{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"town"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"town"}]}],"literal":"The king's request for alliance he will not grant, he who has elephants with uplifted tusks / The young woman with beautiful flower garlands and beautiful foliage on her loins, / and anklets with red spots, her father / has a strong doorpost fashioned with a wooden bolt, / and fresh banners waving on the rampart wall of the fortress. / … / With a fierce-eyed kin like a pack of tigers, / he does not change his word, having furious anger. / Saying 'gather flowers!', he commanded and entered the pond. / The gentle-natured woman adorned with shining jewels, / with her tomorrow, who has beautiful breasts adorned with beauty spots, / either entering marriage will happen, / or, with a body that resisted long-bladed spears in difficult battles fought with rising valor, / entering the world of no return is the other option, saying thus, / the chief grasped his weapon. Meanwhile, / like a cool pond stirred up by fighting male elephants, / will it lose its great beauty, / this town in the cool agricultural tract with gentle waters?","translation":"The father of the young girl—who wears beautiful flower garlands and fresh leaf-garments on her hips, and anklets with red engravings—refuses to grant the king’s request for alliance, though the king brings elephants with uplifted tusks. The father’s fortress has strong doors bolted with heavy wooden bars, and fresh banners wave from its ramparts. Surrounded by fierce-eyed kinsmen who are like a pack of tigers, he never goes back on his word and is filled with furious anger. Saying, 'Go gather flowers,' he commanded his men and entered the pond. Meanwhile, the young chief has grasped his weapon, saying: 'Either tomorrow will be the day I enter into marriage with that gentle-natured girl adorned with shining jewels and beauty spots on her beautiful breasts, or I shall enter the world of no return with a body scarred by long-bladed spears in fierce battles fought with rising valor.' Like a cool pond muddied and stirred up by fighting male elephants, will this town in the fertile agricultural tract of gentle waters lose its great beauty?","modern":"உயர்ந்த தந்தங்களை உடைய யானைகளைக் கொண்டு வந்து அரசன் பெண் கேட்டபோதும், அவளது தந்தை அதற்கு உடன்படவில்லை. அழகிய பூமாலைகளையும் தழையாடையையும் அல்குலில் அணிந்தவளும், செம்புள்ளிகள் பதித்த சிலம்புகளை அணிந்தவளுமான அந்த இளம்பெண்ணின் தந்தை, பெரிய மரத்தாழ்ப்பாள் கொண்ட வலிமையான கதவுகளையும், புதிய கொடிகள் அசையும் மதில்களையும் உடைய கோட்டையைக் கொண்டுள்ளான். புலிக்குட்டம் போன்ற அஞ்சாத சுற்றத்தாரோடு, சொன்ன சொல் தவறாத சினமிக்கவன் அவன். 'பூக்களைப் பறித்து வாருங்கள்' என்று தன் வீரர்களுக்குக் கட்டளையிட்டு அவன் குளத்தில் இறங்கியுள்ளான். அதே நேரத்தில், மற்றொரு தலைவன் தன் ஆயுதத்தைக் கையில் ஏந்தி, 'நாளை அழகிய அணிகலன்களையும் தேமல் படர்ந்த மார்பகங்களையும் உடைய அந்த மெல்லியலாளோடு எனக்குத் திருமணம் நடக்க வேண்டும்; அல்லது, போர்க்களத்தில் நெடிய வேல்களால் காயம்பட்ட உடம்போடு நான் இறந்து மேலுலகம் செல்ல வேண்டும்' என்று வஞ்சினம் கூறுகிறான். போரிடும் ஆண் யானைகளால் கலங்கிப்போன குளிர்ந்த குளத்தைப் போல, மென்மையான நீர் வளம் கொண்ட மருத நிலத்து இந்த அழகிய ஊர் தன் பொலிவை இழந்துவிடுமோ?","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Puram genre, specifically the theme of 'Makaṭpāṟ Kāñci' (the tragedy of a daughter's beauty), where a local chief refuses to give his daughter in marriage to a powerful king, leading to an impending war. The poet Paranar describes the girl's father as a fierce warrior with a heavily fortified home, surrounded by loyal, tiger-like kinsmen, who refuses the king's alliance. Meanwhile, a young suitor (or the king's champion) prepares for battle, declaring that he will either marry the beautiful girl tomorrow or die heroically on the battlefield. The poet laments the fate of the peaceful, fertile town, comparing its impending destruction to a beautiful, cool pond being violently churned and ruined by fighting bull elephants. The imagery of the peaceful agricultural landscape ('marutham') contrasted with the violent clash of warriors highlights the tragic cost of pride and beauty.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.69],[0.69,1.24],[1.24,1.79],[1.79,2.61],[2.61,3.16],[3.16,3.57],[3.57,4.26],[4.26,4.81],[4.81,5.5],[5.5,6.0],[6.0,6.4],[6.4,6.9],[6.9,8.0],[8.0,8.4],[8.4,8.8],[8.8,9.2],[9.2,9.85],[10.01,10.18],[10.34,11.0],[11.0,11.5],[11.5,12.5],[12.57,12.73],[12.8,13.2],[13.2,13.98],[13.98,14.39],[14.39,14.7],[14.7,15.0],[15.0,16.0],[16.37,16.74],[16.74,16.94],[16.94,17.35],[17.35,17.86],[17.86,18.6],[19.4,20.3],[20.3,20.5],[20.5,20.8],[20.95,21.4],[21.4,22.0],[22.0,22.5],[22.5,23.0],[23.0,23.2],[23.2,23.56],[23.56,24.18],[24.18,25.0],[25.0,25.8],[25.8,25.93],[25.93,26.3],[26.3,26.84],[26.84,27.62],[27.62,28.4],[28.56,28.72],[28.8,29.2],[29.2,29.7],[29.7,30.2],[30.2,30.4],[30.4,30.8],[30.8,31.1],[31.1,31.4],[31.4,32.34],[32.72,33.1],[33.1,33.63],[33.63,34.02],[34.02,34.6],[34.6,34.8],[34.96,35.5],[35.5,35.8],[36.56,37.32],[37.32,37.95],[37.95,38.33],[38.33,38.96],[38.96,39.44],[39.44,39.76],[39.76,40.26]],"female":[[0.0,0.72],[0.72,1.3],[1.3,1.88],[1.88,2.74],[2.74,3.32],[3.32,3.76],[3.76,4.48],[4.48,5.06],[5.06,5.78],[5.78,6.5],[6.5,6.8],[6.8,7.5],[7.5,8.7],[8.7,9.12],[9.12,9.68],[9.68,10.02],[10.02,10.89],[10.89,11.41],[11.41,12.1],[12.1,12.6],[12.6,13.7],[13.7,14.0],[14.0,14.3],[14.3,14.6],[14.6,15.8],[15.8,16.0],[16.0,16.3],[16.3,17.2